      "testCaseID": "TC_NYBE_CE200_005_LIMITED_LIABILITY_PARTNERSHIP",
      "description": "Sign in through NY.gov, open the Test Dashboard and start the CE200 interview for an LLP, complete entity setup, Workers Comp Disability, Permit License Contract, Job Site Location, Workers Comp Exemption, Temp Service Agency, Disability Exemption, Application Submitter and Attestation, then submit the application.",
